       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Module »zidCode«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »zidCode« module supports efficient and optimal order preparation in the ZOLLER software TMS Tool Management Solutions as well as in the image processing software »pilot 4.0« through its intuitive operation.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/4/csm_software_modulzidcode_2043300238.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c952",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»quickPick« storage module",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »quickPick« storage module is the simple storage interface for handling individual components, complete tools, devices, orders and accessories. You can make stock bookings with just a few clicks.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/6/csm_software_quickpick_009cb1287c.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c953",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "NC program management - »zidCode 4.0«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With the NC program management from ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions and transmission by »zidCode 4.0«, everything the machine needs for reliable processes is available.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/4/csm_software_nc-programmverwaltung_ef69649c40.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c954",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»idChip technology«- »zidCode 4.0«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>If the DataMatrix code on the integrated chip of the tool is scanned, the CNC machine receives all the necessary tool data via the network.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/7/csm_software_idchip_9694061981.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c955",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c933",
