    "before": "none",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Interfaces for smooth processes </h2>",
   "body": "<p>More than 20 interfaces enable connection to CAM systems. Maintain the tool data only once in the central tool database and access this data directly from your programming system. Create setup sheets for the subsequent manufacturing process directly in the CAM system.<br/><br/><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3753\">CAM interfaces</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3754\">»z.DMI technology«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/8/csm_schnittstellen_arbeitsplatz_a6313cdac3.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1200,
     "h": 1200
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c956",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/a/csm_cam-schnittstellen_c3f54f119d.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 681
   },
   "title": "CAM interfaces",
   "text": "<p>Ensure increased process reliability through simulation with real available tools and offer the efficient use of your tools through standardization of tool lists with visible cost minimization.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3753",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/f/csm_zdmi-technologie_e20872edc9.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 392
   },
   "title": "»e.g. DMI technology«",
   "text": "<p>Enables the direct transfer of tool data to the tool memory of the machine control system and back to the database e.One. This bidirectional data transfer automatically keeps tool life data up to date, for example.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3754",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "hotspots",
   "header": "<h2> Network your production </h2>",
   "intro": "",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/3/csm_zidcode_vernetzung_1c2e55d6b5.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1540,
    "h": 704
   },
   "spots": [
    {
     "x": 13.024,
     "y": 32.436,
     "label": "Integrated CAM interfaces",
     "text": "<h3>Integrated CAM interfaces</h3> <h4>Integrated CAM interfaces</h4> <p>The production processes are simulated in the CAM system using tool data from the cloud. The tool data from the CAM system is transferred directly to the ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions in the form of a setup sheet.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 28.675,
     "y": 79.437,
     "label": "Structured tool preparation",
     "text": "<h3>Structured tool preparation</h3> <p>Structured tool preparation</p> <p>In the ZOLLER Smart Cabinets and with the help of the ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions software, tools, components, accessories and complete tools are digitally recorded and can be localized. The prepared complete tools are identified and measured on the ZOLLER presetting and measuring machine. The tool data is then directly available on the machine control system.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 39.519,
     "y": 30.477,
     "label": "Database z.One",
     "text": "<h3>Database z.One</h3> <h4>z.One database</h4> <p>z.One is the central tool database. All stations in the production process access this database, as well as ERP and other software systems. Multiple data maintenance is not necessary.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 44.606,
     "y": 12.607,
     "label": "TMS Tool Management Solutions Software",
     "text": "<h3>TMS Tool Management Solutions Software</h3> <h4>TMS Tool Management Solutions Software</h4> <p>The TMS Tool Management Solutions software is perfectly integrated into the overall process and offers everything for efficient tool management. This software solution can be networked with CAM, ERP and other systems.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 64.449,
     "y": 28.152,
     "label": "Efficient production",
     "text": "<h3>Efficient production</h3> <h4>Efficient production</h4> <p>All tool data from the tool holder with integrated ZOLLER »idChip technology« is transferred to the machine via »zidCode 4.0.« The scanning process at the zidCode »4.0« control unit ensures fast, simple and error-free data transfer.</p>"
    }
   ],
